WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.807 --> 00:00:14.348
wrong with our swords and spears?"

2
00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:15.448
asked the gibbon.

3
00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:19.370
"They're fine for normal monkeys and apes," said Wukong.

4
00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:21.932
I am very powerful.

5
00:00:22.352 --> 00:00:23.652
I need a much heavier weapon."

6
00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:26.234
The gibbon thought for a minute.

7
00:00:26.254 --> 00:00:30.636
"A dragon king lives at the bottom of the Eastern Sea," he said.

8
00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:33.398
"Maybe he has a weapon you can use."

9
00:00:34.819 --> 00:00:36.401
a good idea," said Wukong.

10
00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:37.681
"I'll be back soon!"

11
00:00:43.145 --> 00:00:45.787
He said a quick spell so he could breathe underwater.

12
00:00:48.269 --> 00:00:49.790
Then he dived into the stream.

13
00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:57.876
He swam to the ocean and went deeper and deeper.

14
00:01:01.976 --> 00:01:03.918
Soon he arrived at a large palace.

15
00:01:05.599 --> 00:01:09.462
The Dragon King and the Dragon Queen were sitting at a table, having tea.

16
00:01:10.523 --> 00:01:13.265
The Dragon King looked over when Wukong walked in.

17
00:01:13.285 --> 00:01:15.147
"Who are you?"

18
00:01:15.527 --> 00:01:16.568
asked the Dragon King.

19
00:01:16.588 --> 00:01:20.571
"I'm king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain," said Wukong.

20
00:01:20.591 --> 00:01:22.813
"My name is Sun Wukong."

21
00:01:24.034 --> 00:01:25.996
nice to meet you," said the queen.

22
00:01:26.016 --> 00:01:28.237
"Would you like some tea?"

23
00:01:28.318 --> 00:01:31.060
"No, thank you," said Wukong.

24
00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:34.929
need a heavy weapon because I'm as strong as a god.

25
00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:37.910
I want one of yours."

26
00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:44.532
"Well," said the Dragon King, "I suppose I could find a weapon for you."

27
00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:48.353
The Dragon King looked at a turtle soldier.

28
00:01:48.373 --> 00:01:51.854
"Find a heavy weapon for Sun Wukong."

29
00:01:53.254 --> 00:01:54.654
The turtle went out of the room.

30
00:01:56.515 --> 00:02:00.296
He soon came back, slowly dragging a huge sword.

31
00:02:02.796 --> 00:02:05.578
He dropped the sword and then fell down, out of breath.

32
00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.022
Wukong picked up the sword with no trouble at all.

33
00:02:16.624 --> 00:02:19.425
He waved the sword through the air, pretending to fight.

34
00:02:21.346 --> 00:02:23.347
sword is too light," said Wukong.

35
00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:25.588
"Find me a better weapon!"

36
00:02:26.829 --> 00:02:31.752
"This monkey is rude," the Dragon Queen whispered to her husband.

37
00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.321
"You're right, dear," the Dragon King whispered back.

38
00:02:35.341 --> 00:02:38.342
"Let's find him something quickly so he'll leave."

39
00:02:40.602 --> 00:02:45.864
A few minutes later, several turtles and octopuses dragged an enormous spear into the room.

40
00:02:49.925 --> 00:02:50.905
said the Dragon King.

41
00:02:50.925 --> 00:02:53.686
"That looks like a very heavy weapon.

42
00:02:54.046 --> 00:02:55.046
Right, Wukong?"

43
00:02:57.787 --> 00:03:00.948
Wukong lifted the spear and began stabbing at the air.

44
00:03:03.808 --> 00:03:04.429
shook his head.

45
00:03:04.449 --> 00:03:06.809
"This spear is too light."

46
00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.570
The Dragon King snorted.

47
00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.231
spear is very heavy!

48
00:03:13.031 --> 00:03:14.632
How can you say it's too light?"

49
00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:18.773
me, it's light," said Wukong.

50
00:03:18.793 --> 00:03:21.614
"Find me something else!"

51
00:03:24.414 --> 00:03:27.395
"We don't have anything else," said the Dragon King.

52
00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:30.276
"That's the heaviest weapon we have."

53
00:03:32.237 --> 00:03:33.137
stomped his foot.

54
00:03:33.157 --> 00:03:36.520
"I'm not leaving until I get what I want!"

55
00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.503
"This is an outrage!"

56
00:03:40.843 --> 00:03:41.884
said the Dragon King.

57
00:03:42.905 --> 00:03:44.646
The queen whispered to him again.

58
00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:48.649
"What about the magical iron bar in the treasury?

59
00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.351
I'm sure that's heavy enough."

60
00:03:51.371 --> 00:03:55.694
"We can't give that to him," said the Dragon King.

61
00:03:55.714 --> 00:03:58.076
"It's a treasure from Heaven."

62
00:03:59.777 --> 00:04:01.558
cares?" said the queen.

63
00:04:01.578 --> 00:04:07.142
"I just want this monkey out of my palace!"

64
00:04:07.663 --> 00:04:09.204
The Dragon King sighed.

65
00:04:09.224 --> 00:04:13.688
"Wukong, we might have something heavy enough for you."

66
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:16.410
"Bring it here," said Wukong.

67
00:04:17.651 --> 00:04:19.372
can't," said the Dragon King.

68
00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:22.054
"It's too heavy for anyone to lift.

69
00:04:23.175 --> 00:04:25.677
But if you can lift it, we'll let you have it."

70
00:04:25.697 --> 00:04:28.860
"Show me where it is," said Wukong.

71
00:04:30.913 --> 00:04:32.474
The group went to the treasury.

72
00:04:35.457 --> 00:04:38.599
An enormous iron pillar stood in the center of the room.

73
00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.942
Beams of golden light shone from it.

74
00:04:41.962 --> 00:04:47.647
"That pillar was used to measure all the oceans and rivers," said the Dragon King.

75
00:04:49.928 --> 00:04:53.431
Wukong went closer and looked up at the large piece of iron.

76
00:04:54.852 --> 00:04:56.874
Dragon King folded his arms.

77
00:04:56.894 --> 00:05:00.387
"If you can pick it up, you can have
